  "vv77:0.4": "3. Maṇithūṇavimānavatthu 1126. ",
  "vv77:1.1": "‘‘Uccamidaṃ maṇithūṇaṃ vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv77:1.2": "samantato dvādasa yojanāni; ",
  "vv77:1.3": "Kūṭāgārā sattasatā uḷārā, ",
  "vv77:1.4": "veḷuriyathambhā rucakatthatā subhā. ",
  "vv77:2.1": "1127. ‘‘Tatthacchasi pivasi khādasi ca, ",
  "vv77:2.2": "dibbā ca vīṇā pavadanti vagguṃ; ",
  "vv77:2.3": "Dibbā rasā kāmaguṇettha pañca, ",
  "vv77:2.4": "nāriyo ca naccanti suvaṇṇachannā. ",
  "vv77:3.1": "1128. ‘‘Kena tetādiso vaṇṇo ",
  "vv77:3.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv77:3.3": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv77:4.1": "1130. So devaputto attamano ",
  "vv77:4.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv77:4.3": "yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "vv77:5.1": "1131. ‘‘Ahaṃ manussesu manussabhūto, ",
  "vv77:5.2": "vivane pathe saṅkamanaṃ akāsiṃ; ",
  "vv77:5.3": "Ārāmarukkhāni ca ropayissaṃ, ",
  "vv77:5.4": "piyā ca me sīlavanto ahesuṃ; ",
  "vv77:5.5": "Annañca pānañca pasannacitto, ",
  "vv77:5.6": "sakkacca dānaṃ vipulaṃ adāsiṃ. ",
  "vv77:6.1": "1132. ‘‘Tena metādiso vaṇṇo ",
  "vv77:6.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv77:6.3": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv77:7.1": "Maṇithūṇavimānaṃ tatiyaṃ. "
}
